            <p><strong>Basement finishing</strong> converts an unfinished, raw basement into livable space &mdash; framing, insulation, drywall, flooring, lighting, from scratch. <strong>Basement remodeling</strong> updates or reconfigures an already-finished basement &mdash; new flooring, adding a bathroom, converting an open rec room into defined spaces, or updating a dated wet bar. ProBrothers handles both. If you&apos;re unsure which scope you need, a free in-home consultation with our team will clarify the right approach.</p>
